Brand hardware requirements list
title end

paragraph start
Write the need first and the device second. For each brand task, such as drawing a logo or checking colours, write what it needs, the minimum that works and whether it is a must or a nice to have.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Start from the equipment the owner already has and list only the gaps.
paragraph end

